    shape: | # I-beam / bone shape, parameterized by h x w
      V (h>w): row 0 = centered 3px cap; row 1 = full-width bar with 1px center gap;
        rows 2..h-3 = left+right 1px walls; row h-2 = mirror of row 1; row h-1 = mirror of row 0
      H (w>h): transpose of V pattern (caps on left/right sides)
    dimensions:
